  "description": "A child is one day abandoned at the home of a goblin born from a beautiful flower shoe. It is the child of a man who fled after spending a night together while promising marriage. The goblin reluctantly takes the child in as a servant and gives them the name “Bam”. Unaware that the child will later come to harbor intense, burning feelings of love toward them…\n\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000057717)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/305078/)",
